'\" t
.TH "ACTON\-REVERSE" "1"
.nh
.ad l
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.SH "NAME"
acton\-reverse \[em] Build TON state\-flow reverse\-engineering artifacts
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBacton reverse\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIcommand\fR
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
\fBacton reverse\fR is the Acton\-native TON state\-machine reverse\-engineering
surface. It emits reusable JSON and Markdown artifacts instead of one\-off logs,
so CLI commands, the Test UI, localnet UI, fork replay checks, and audit
handoffs can consume the same evidence model.
.sp
The command group is organized around the state\-flow loop:
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBretrace\fR exports one \fBStateFlowTx\fR evidence JSON for a known transaction
hash
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBcollect\fR turns recent account history into a corpus of retraced
transactions
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBinfer\fR clusters the corpus by opcode and proposes message, storage, replay,
outbound effect, state\-machine, confidence, and unknown\-field surfaces
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBreplay\fR replays or mutates a \fBStateFlowTx\fR on the same pre\-state and emits a
diff
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBreport\fR renders corpus, schema, and replay artifacts into a Markdown audit
report
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBanalyze\fR runs collect, infer, replay, and report for one target address
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBsmoke\fR runs checked\-in real\-chain targets through the full loop and writes
a manifest bundle
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBverify\-artifacts\fR validates that a bundle still contains the evidence needed
for the short\-, medium\-, and long\-term reverse workflow
.RE
.SH "ARTIFACT MODEL"
The primary single\-transaction artifact is \fBStateFlowTx\fR\&. It includes:
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'transaction identity and replay context
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'pre/post shard account state, including code/data hashes and cell shapes
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'inbound message body/opcode evidence
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'outbound messages and parsed out actions
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'VM trace and executor trace logs
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'c5/out\-action cell evidence
.RE
.sp
The higher\-level artifacts reuse the same model:
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'corpus JSON contains retraced \fBStateFlowTx\fR entries and collection failures
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'schema JSON contains opcode candidates, message/storage/effect surfaces,
replay probes, confidence, unknown fields, and audit signals
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'replay diff JSON compares baseline and mutated observations from the same
pre\-state
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'report Markdown renders the evidence tables used by review and audit
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'artifact manifests preserve target context, paths, and validation capability
checks
.RE
.SH "SUBCOMMANDS"
.SS "acton reverse retrace"
Replay one transaction and emit \fBStateFlowTx\fR JSON.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse retrace\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIhash\fR
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIhash\fR
.RS 4
Transaction hash in hex format to retrace.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-net\fR \fInetwork\fR
.RS 4
Network to use.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write state\-flow JSON to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse collect"
Collect recent account history into a state\-flow corpus.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse collect\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIaddress\fR
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIaddress\fR
.RS 4
Account address in friendly or raw format.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-net\fR \fInetwork\fR
.RS 4
Network to use.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fIcount\fR
.RS 4
Maximum number of recent account transactions to collect.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write state\-flow corpus JSON to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse infer"
Infer opcode and effect schema candidates from a state\-flow corpus or artifact
manifest.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse infer\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIcorpus\fR]
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIcorpus\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow corpus JSON produced by \fBacton reverse collect\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-artifact\-manifest\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow artifact manifest produced by \fBacton reverse smoke\fR or
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Target id to select from an artifact manifest.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write schema candidate JSON to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse replay"
Replay or mutate a \fBStateFlowTx\fR or corpus artifact and emit a diff.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse replay\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIstate\-flow\fR]
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIstate\-flow\fR
.RS 4
\fBStateFlowTx\fR JSON from \fBacton reverse retrace\fR or corpus JSON from
\fBacton reverse collect\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-artifact\-manifest\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow artifact manifest produced by \fBacton reverse smoke\fR or
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Target id to select from an artifact manifest.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-tx\-index\fR \fIindex\fR
.RS 4
Transaction index to replay when the input is a corpus artifact.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-tx\-hash\fR \fIhash\fR
.RS 4
Transaction hash to replay when the input is a corpus artifact.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-replay\-probe\fR \fIfield\fR
.RS 4
Replay an inferred schema probe from an artifact manifest.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-flip\-body\-bit\fR \fIbit\fR
.RS 4
Flip one inbound message body bit before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-body\-boc64\fR \fIboc64\fR
.RS 4
Replace inbound message body with this base64 BoC before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-set\-body\-uint\fR \fIoffset:bits:value\fR
.RS 4
Set an unsigned integer field in the inbound body before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-ignore\-chksig\fR
.RS 4
Ignore TVM signature checks during local replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write replay diff JSON to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse report"
Generate a state\-flow reverse\-engineering report.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse report\fR [\fIoptions\fR] [\fIcorpus\fR]
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIcorpus\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow corpus JSON produced by \fBacton reverse collect\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-schema\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Schema candidate JSON produced by \fBacton reverse infer\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-replay\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Replay diff JSON produced by \fBacton reverse replay\fR\&. May be repeated.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-artifact\-manifest\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow artifact manifest produced by \fBacton reverse smoke\fR or
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Target id to select from an artifact manifest.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write Markdown report to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse verify-artifacts"
Validate a state\-flow artifact manifest bundle.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse verify\-artifacts\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIartifacts\fR
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIartifacts\fR
.RS 4
State\-flow artifact manifest produced by \fBacton reverse smoke\fR or
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR\&.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Only validate artifacts for this target id.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Write artifact validation JSON to a file. \fB\-\-out\fR is also accepted.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse analyze"
Run collect, infer, replay, and report for one target address.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIaddress\fR
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fIaddress\fR
.RS 4
Account address in friendly or raw format.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-net\fR \fInetwork\fR
.RS 4
Network to use.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Target id to write into summary, manifest, validation, and output paths.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-source\-url\fR \fIurl\fR
.RS 4
Source URL for the analyzed target.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-notes\fR \fItext\fR
.RS 4
Human notes to preserve in the generated target artifacts.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fIcount\fR
.RS 4
Maximum number of recent account transactions to collect.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-retrace\-tx\-hash\fR \fIhash\fR
.RS 4
Transaction hash to retrace into \fBretrace.json\fR for this analysis target.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-replay\-tx\-index\fR \fIindex\fR
.RS 4
Corpus transaction index to replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-replay\-tx\-hash\fR \fIhash\fR
.RS 4
Corpus transaction hash to replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-flip\-body\-bit\fR \fIbit\fR
.RS 4
Flip one inbound message body bit before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-body\-boc64\fR \fIboc64\fR
.RS 4
Replace inbound message body with this base64 BoC before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-set\-body\-uint\fR \fIoffset:bits:value\fR
.RS 4
Set an unsigned integer field in the inbound body before replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-ignore\-chksig\fR
.RS 4
Ignore TVM signature checks during local replay.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Directory for analysis output artifacts.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output artifacts.
.RE
.SS "acton reverse smoke"
Run state\-flow smoke targets through collect, infer, replay, and report.
.SS "Synopsis"
\fBacton reverse smoke\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SS "Options"
.sp
\fB\-\-targets\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Smoke target manifest JSON.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-target\-id\fR \fIid\fR
.RS 4
Only run the smoke target with this id.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-out\-dir\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Directory for smoke output artifacts.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
.RS 4
Pretty\-print JSON output artifacts.
.RE
.SS "Display Options"
.sp
\fB\-\-color\fR \fIwhen\fR
.RS 4
Control when to use colored output.
.sp
Possible values: \fBauto\fR, \fBalways\fR, \fBnever\fR
.RE
.SS "Project Options"
.sp
\fB\-\-manifest\-path\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Path to the \fBActon.toml\fR file to use for this invocation.
.sp
Use this when running the command outside the project directory or when the
manifest lives at a non\-default location.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-project\-root\fR \fIpath\fR
.RS 4
Path to the project root to use for configuration discovery and relative
defaults.
.sp
This conflicts with \fB\-\-manifest\-path\fR\&.
.RE
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
Built\-in \fBmainnet\fR/\fBtestnet\fR requests read \fBTONCENTER_MAINNET_API_KEY\fR or
\fBTONCENTER_TESTNET_API_KEY\fR, depending on the selected network.
.sp
Both built\-in networks also fall back to \fBTON_CENTER_API_KEY\fR, which is useful
when one shared key is kept in a local \fB\&.env\fR file.
.sp
Acton loads \fB\&.env\fR automatically, so the simplest setup during project work is
usually to keep these keys there and use shell environment variables only for
one\-off overrides or CI.
.SH "OUTPUT LAYOUT"
\fBacton reverse analyze\fR and \fBacton reverse smoke\fR write a bundle directory with
these stable paths:
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBsummary.json\fR: run\-level target status and output paths
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBartifacts.json\fR: portable artifact manifest
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fBvalidation.json\fR: bundle validation result and capability checks
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/corpus.json\fR: collected retraced transactions
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/schema.json\fR: inferred schema and state\-machine surfaces
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/transaction\-<n>.json\fR: selected replay source transaction
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/retrace.json\fR: explicit retrace target when configured
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/replay*.json\fR: replay diffs, including schema probe replays
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB<target>/report.md\fR: rendered state\-flow report
.RE
.sp
Use \fBacton reverse verify\-artifacts artifacts.json\fR after moving or archiving a
bundle to prove that all required evidence is still present and internally
consistent.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB0\fR: The requested artifact was generated or validated successfully.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\fB1\fR: Network lookup, retrace, replay, parsing, artifact validation, or output
writing failed.
.RE
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 1.\h'+01'Export a single transaction evidence JSON:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton reverse retrace bd4352bc4c89b3a5ea8af3667baf67b6a73d3b4873b1ef604c746831b3a14566 \(rs
    \-\-net mainnet \-\-out tx.json \-\-pretty
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 2.\h'+01'Run one address through the full collect\-infer\-replay\-report loop:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton reverse analyze EQAgvOlWk7C0Pz3YgSaX\-MA7UDDhE9n6eQgQRwJahOBm4VKr \(rs
    \-\-net mainnet \(rs
    \-\-target\-id tonviewer\-requested\-target \(rs
    \-\-source\-url https://tonviewer.com/EQAgvOlWk7C0Pz3YgSaX\-MA7UDDhE9n6eQgQRwJahOBm4VKr \(rs
    \-\-retrace\-tx\-hash bd4352bc4c89b3a5ea8af3667baf67b6a73d3b4873b1ef604c746831b3a14566 \(rs
    \-\-flip\-body\-bit 0 \(rs
    \-\-ignore\-chksig \(rs
    \-\-out\-dir target/stateflow\-analysis \(rs
    \-\-pretty
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 3.\h'+01'Verify a generated bundle:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton reverse verify\-artifacts target/stateflow\-analysis/artifacts.json \-\-pretty
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 4.\h'+01'Load an inferred replay probe from a manifest:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton reverse replay \-\-artifact\-manifest target/stateflow\-analysis/artifacts.json \(rs
    \-\-target\-id tonviewer\-requested\-target \(rs
    \-\-replay\-probe 0xd5e3832f:query_id \(rs
    \-\-ignore\-chksig \(rs
    \-\-out replay\-query\-id.json \(rs
    \-\-pretty
.fi
.RE
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
\h'-04' 5.\h'+01'Render a report from a manifest:
.sp
.RS 4
.nf
acton reverse report \-\-artifact\-manifest target/stateflow\-analysis/artifacts.json \(rs
    \-\-target\-id tonviewer\-requested\-target \(rs
    \-\-out report.md
.fi
.RE
.RE
